ble to find that uh the  local school that got eu funding  and they've also now plotted um  how many eu staff there on are in every  hospital in the united kingdom  so you can go to the uh hospital which  where theresa may recently launched the  uh nhs  long-term plan and find out that it had  about 50 million pounds worth of eu  funding  and has about 200 200 uh eu  staff uh on my eu so that's pretty cool  um  it got uh tweeted by turned out by jk  rowling and hugh grant  and we are doing many more products um  we've also done final say dot  app final say dot app um you go to your  uh  it's a mobile web app you go there you  type in your post code you get your mp  you record them a message it gets sent  to them privately for a private inbox  if you want to send them a private  message or it can be public  and that is going viral at the moment  and uh and you  we publish the public the publicly  public public  messages are published on soundcloud and  you can listen to them they're quite  visceral  actually to listen to people why they  would like a final say on the whole  issue um and uh  so we yeah so as i said that's how we  did my uk we've had incredible number of  users  and it's still ticking over at the  moment we've got some launch  products and we've now got some some  under development  and one of the big pro issues that we've  realized is we want to put everything in  one place and we want to develop a  platform  so that people can go and find their  local mp not necessarily by postpo  code but by where they live we want them  to  uh be able to find out what their mp  thinks about brexit  we want to think we want to make it  easier for people to write to them  things like that  um and we've got tad more for instance  we've got a shopping bus we've got a  data science  project where we want to find out how  much it cost to do your weekly shop  and then what's it going to be like now  and what's going to be like after brexit  visions of the road and things 